# The database holds wallet addresses, nonces, receipt hashes and session
# rows. Sessions store a sha256 of the token rather than the token, so a
# leak would not hand anyone a working login — but it is still real user
# data. SQLite writes three files; the -wal carries recent writes and is
# usually the largest.
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Secrets. Railway holds the real values as environment variables.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

node_modules/
off-cache/

# Stale copies of the frontend, which lives in pergram-app. They are kept
# on disk for now but do not belong in this repo: publishing a second,
# older copy of a file is how the wrong one gets edited.
api.js
api-v2.js
index.html

# OS and editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Local scratch
*.log
npm-debug.log*
